<li>Educational Migration: A prominent university utilized All-in-One WP Migration to migrate and consolidate multiple departmental sites into a single WordPress network, with automated backups ensuring no data was lost during migration.</li>
<li>Government Migration: Following a directive to improve digital accessibility, a government agency used our migration plugin to migrate their content to a new, compliant platform without impacting public access to critical information.</li>
</ul>
