('Hostinger Tools', 'hostinger', '3.0.65', '<p>Hostinger Tools is an all-in-one plugin designed to streamline essential tasks for WordPress site administrators. This plugin offers a range of features to help you manage your site&#8217;s information, maintenance mode, security, and redirects effectively.</p>
