* <strong>Archives</strong>: Admin can create, archive and extract files(zip, rar, tar, gzip).<br />
* <strong>File Size</strong>: Admin/User can upload any size files.<br />
* <strong>File Type</strong>: Control what files can be uploaded and what file can be downloaded.<br />
