* <strong>Shortcut Support</strong>: Common shortcuts are available in File Manager<br />
* <strong>Automatic File Resize</strong>: automatically resize files once uploaded.<br />
* <strong>Responsive UI</strong>: File Manager works on tablet and mobile devices<br />
* <strong>Browsing History</strong>: File and folders browsing history<br />
* <strong>Trash function</strong>: Move to Trash Folder Feature<br />
