<li>Select Image</li>
<li>Slider (Drag a Handle)</li>
<li>Slides (Multiple Images, Titles, and Descriptions)</li>
<li>Social Profiles</li>
<li>Sortable (Drag/Drop Checkbox/Input Fields)</li>
