<li>Follow us on Twitter 🐦: <a href="https://twitter.com/reduxframework" rel="nofollow ugc">@ReduxFramework</a></li>
</ul>
<h4>🔐 Privacy</h4>
<p>Redux does not interact with end users on your website. If a product is using Redux, the option panel will cease to function without Redux.</p>
<p>For more details on our privacy policy: <a href="https://redux.io/privacy" rel="nofollow ugc">https://redux.io/privacy</a><br />
For more details on our terms and conditions: <a href="https://redux.io/terms" rel="nofollow ugc">https://redux.io/terms</a></p>
<p>NOTE: Redux is not intended to be used on its own. It requires a config file provided by a third-party theme or plugin developer to actually do anything cool!</p>
