<li>Review widgets for your email signatures</li>
<li>Generate amazing images from your reviews to Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, Pinterest</li>
<li>Shortcode &amp; HTML/JavaScript support</li>
<li>Detailed statistics</li>
<li>Priority support</li>
<li>AMP support</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://www.trustindex.io/ti-redirect.php?a=sys-wp&amp;c=google.php-r2" rel="nofollow ugc">Create a Free Account for More Features</a></p>
