<li><strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GUMeRd4W_bM&amp;ab_channel=NEXTEND" rel="nofollow ugc">Totally responsive</a> and touch friendly</strong> &#8211; Sliders can be enjoyed on any device, be it a mobile, tablet or desktop.</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JINCrtiKES8&amp;ab_channel=NEXTEND" rel="nofollow ugc">Dynamic Slides</a></strong> &#8211; Available source: WordPress posts</li>
