<li><strong>Font and Style manager system</strong> &#8211; Change easily all the details that really matter in typography and style.</li>
<li><strong>Template sliders</strong> &#8211; <a href="https://smartslider3.com/tag/free" rel="nofollow ugc">15 sliders</a> to start</li>
</ul>
<h4>Features:</h4>
<ul>
<li>Import and Export sliders</li>
