<p><a href="https://holithemes.com/plugins/click-to-chat/shortcodes-chat/" rel="nofollow ugc">Shortcodes for Chat</a></p>
<h4>Group</h4>
<p>Enable the Group chat feature and add WhatsApp Group id in the plugin settings.</p>
