('Database Addon for Contact Form 7 &#8211; CFDB7', 'contact-form-cfdb7', '1.3.5', '<p>The &#8220;CFDB7&#8221; plugin saves contact form 7 submissions to your WordPress database. Export the data to a CSV file.<br />
