<li><strong>Google News Sitemap:</strong> Google news sitemaps are special sitemap, specifically for content, which is time bound, and helps in making content eligible to be shown on Google&#8217;s News surface.</li>
<li><strong>Structured Data:</strong> Helps search engines understand your website better, as it adds Structured data markup.</li>
<li><strong>Breadcrumbs:</strong> Helps improve the navigation for users.</li>
