<li>Show multiple ‘Add to Cart’ buttons in the wishlist table</li>
<li>Show product price variations (Amazon style)</li>
<li>Allow users to move an element from one wishlist to another, right from the wishlist table</li>
<li>Allow users to drag and drop products to arrange their order in the wishlist</li>
<li>Choose modern &amp; beautiful layouts for the wishlist page and tables</li>
<li>Provide your customers with nice widgets to help them find their wishlist quickly and easily.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://yithemes.com/themes/plugins/yith-woocommerce-wishlist/" rel="nofollow ugc">GET THE PREMIUM VERSION HERE with a 100% Money Back guarantee &gt;</a></p>
