Change widget language for WPML and multi-language websites<br />
Different chat widgets for different products and categories<br />
Different chats buttons based on purpose (support, sales, etc)</li>
<li>Traffic source targeting – show the chat channels only to visitors who come from traffic sources </li>
<li>Widget Analytics &#8211; data about your chat channels</li>
<li>Font Awesome support</li>
