</li>
<li>
<p>Discord &#8211; Discord is a VoIP and instant messaging social platform.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Microsoft Teams &#8211; Microsoft Teams is a chat communication platform.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Link to an external channel/contact page.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Poptin popup &#8211; launch a popup from your Poptin.com account.</p>
