('Post SMTP – Complete Email Deliverability and SMTP Solution with Email Logs, Alerts, Backup SMTP &amp; Mobile App', 'post-smtp', '3.9.1', '<p><a href="https://postmansmtp.com/pricing/?utm_source=wp_org&amp;utm_medium=read_me" rel="nofollow ugc">👑 Go Pro</a> | <a href="https://www.tastewp.com/plugins/post-smtp" rel="nofollow ugc">💻Live Demo</a> | <a href="https://postmansmtp.com/extension/?utm_source=wp_org&amp;utm_medium=readme_top" rel="nofollow ugc">🔌Extensions</a> | <a href="https://postmansmtp.com/documentation/advance-functionality/postsmtp-mobile-app/?utm_source=wp_org&amp;utm_medium=readme_top" rel="nofollow ugc">📱Mobile Application</a></p>
