<p>Are you facing the WordPress not sending emails issue❓Don&#8217;t worry! Install the Post SMTP Plugin <strong>aka</strong> (WordPress mail SMTP plugin), for smooth WordPress email deliverability.</p>
<p>Over <strong>400,000</strong> website owners use <strong>Post SMTP</strong> daily to send WordPress emails securely and reliably💯 using Gmail SMTP, Microsoft Office 365/Outlook, and other SMTP integrations.</p>
