<li>9 May: La Braud</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Persons who recently contributed on <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/rosell-dk" rel="nofollow ugc">github sponsors</a> &#8211; Thanks!</strong><br />
* 16 Dec: kcrlost<br />
* 16 Dec: Yakovos Frountas (Greece)</p>
<p><strong>Persons who contributed with extra generously amounts of coffee / lifetime backing (&gt;80$) &#8211; thanks!:</strong></p>
