', 'wordpress.org'),
('CookieAdmin &#8211; Cookie Consent Banner', 'cookieadmin', '1.1.7', '<p>CookieAdmin is a Lightweight, Bloat-free &amp; easy to use Cookie consent banner plugin which allows you to display a personalized banner on your website for your visitors to choose which cookies they would like to use.</p>
<p>Admins can customize the UI of the consent banner for the frontend to match with their website / brand identity.</p>
