<li>Get the most out of Otter Blocks with our helpful <a href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLmRasCVwuvpSep2MOsIoE0ncO9JE3FcKP" rel="nofollow ugc">YouTube Tutorials Playlist</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>The plugin is relying on the service behind api.themeisle.com for accessing the patterns list, AI prompts and Onboarding. No account is required to access the service template collection and the privacy policy can be found <a href="https://themeisle.com/privacy-policy/" rel="nofollow ugc">here</a>.</p>
