<li><strong>Create custom alerts &amp; notifications</strong> to monitor additional functionality</li>
<li><strong>Import and export plugin settings</strong></li>
<li><strong>Real-time activity log</strong> visible in the WordPress admin toolbar</li>
<li><strong>And much more!</strong></li>
