assist you with verification, CVE assignment, and notify the<br />
developers of this plugin.</p>
', 'wordpress.org'),
('Redirection for Contact Form 7', 'wpcf7-redirect', '3.2.9', '<p>Redirection for Contact Form 7 enhances your forms with essential post-submission actions all in one plugin. Store form entries in your database, redirect users to any page or URL, send email notifications, block spam with honeypot protection, and help with GDPR compliance through data export/erase requests.</p>
