<li>Author avatar URL</li>
<li>Term list</li>
<li>Previous posts URL</li>
<li>Next posts URL</li>
<li>Media</li>
</ul>
<p>In GenerateBlocks Pro, you get additional dynamic tags:</p>
<ul>
<li>Archive title</li>
<li>Archive description</li>
<li>Site option</li>
<li>Term meta</li>
<li>User meta</li>
