('CartFlows – Funnel Builder &amp; Checkout Plugin for WooCommerce', 'cartflows', '2.2.4', '<h3>The #1 WordPress Funnel Builder &amp; WooCommerce Checkout Plugin</h3>
<p>CartFlows is the #1 WordPress funnel builder and WooCommerce checkout plugin—trusted by over 200,000 stores worldwide. Since 2018, CartFlows has helped eCommerce sellers, course creators, agencies, and entrepreneurs turn their WooCommerce stores into high-converting revenue machines.</p>
<p>Your WooCommerce checkout should do more than just work—it should <strong>convert</strong>. CartFlows replaces the clunky default WooCommerce checkout with a sleek, distraction-free, conversion-optimized experience that helps you sell more and maximize average order value (AOV) with every transaction.</p>
<p><a href="https://try.new/cartflows" rel="nofollow ugc">Try the live demo of CartFlows</a></p>
<h3>The Affordable ClickFunnels Alternative Built for WordPress</h3>
<p>Tired of paying $97–$297/month for SaaS funnel builders like ClickFunnels? CartFlows gives you all the same power—unlimited funnels, upsells, order bumps, A/B testing, and analytics—directly inside WordPress, at a fraction of the cost. No monthly SaaS fees. No lock-in. Full control over your data.</p>
<h3>Why Your WooCommerce Store Needs CartFlows</h3>
<p>The default WooCommerce checkout is functional, but far from modern. It lacks the speed, personalization, and seamless experience today&#8217;s customers expect. A clunky checkout loses sales every day, and nobody wants that.</p>
<p>That&#8217;s where CartFlows steps in. With CartFlows, you can:</p>
<ul>
<li>Build a complete WordPress sales funnel without ever leaving your dashboard</li>
<li>Replace WooCommerce&#8217;s default checkout with a modern, conversion-focused page</li>
<li>Add one-click upsells, downsells, and dynamic order bumps to every funnel</li>
<li>Create a one-page checkout, two-step checkout, or multi-step checkout flow</li>
<li>Import professionally designed funnel templates in one click and go live in minutes</li>
<li>Track funnel performance with built-in analytics and a revenue insights dashboard</li>
<li>Automate post-purchase workflows, follow-up emails, and lead nurturing</li>
</ul>
<span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="750" height="422" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/k96jHP9CaYA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span>
<p><a href="https://cartflows.com/whats-new/?utm_source=WordPress&amp;utm_medium=Referral&amp;utm_campaign=CF_description" rel="nofollow ugc">What&#8217;s New</a> | <a href="https://cartflows.com/docs/?utm_source=WordPress&amp;utm_medium=Referral&amp;utm_campaign=CF_description" rel="nofollow ugc">Docs</a> | <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@CartFlows/" rel="nofollow ugc">Video Tutorials</a> | <a href="https://cartflows.com/support/open-a-ticket/?utm_source=WordPress&amp;utm_medium=Referral&amp;utm_campaign=CF_description" rel="nofollow ugc">Get Help</a> | <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/cartflows" rel="nofollow ugc">Community</a></p>
<h3>What Makes CartFlows Unique?</h3>
<p><strong>Built for WooCommerce:</strong> CartFlows is the ultimate checkout plugin and WordPress funnel builder—designed from the ground up to work seamlessly within your existing WooCommerce setup.</p>
<p><strong>Seamless page builder integration:</strong> Works with Elementor, Spectra, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Gutenberg, and more.</p>
<p><strong>Effortless setup:</strong> Pre-designed funnel templates and drag-and-drop editing mean you can build high-converting funnels without touching a line of code.</p>
<p><strong>Revenue boosters:</strong> One-click upsells, downsells, and order bumps help maximize your store&#8217;s average order value (AOV) on every transaction.</p>
<p><strong>Modern checkout styles:</strong> Replace WooCommerce&#8217;s default checkout with sleek, branded layouts—one-column, two-column, multi-step, or instant checkout—all optimized for conversions.</p>
<p><strong>Affordable:</strong> Get advanced funnel builder features without the hefty price tag of SaaS tools like ClickFunnels or Kajabi.</p>
<h3>How It Works</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Install CartFlows:</strong> Activate the WordPress funnel builder from your WordPress dashboard.</li>
<li><strong>Choose a template:</strong> Pick a professionally designed sales funnel and checkout template.</li>
<li><strong>Customize your funnel:</strong> Use your favorite page builder to craft a seamless checkout experience.</li>
<li><strong>Add dynamic offers:</strong> Boost revenue with personalized upsells, downsells, and order bumps.</li>
<li><strong>Optimize with insights:</strong> Use CartFlows&#8217; analytics to refine your funnels and improve performance.</li>
</ol>
<h3>💪 Powerful Features</h3>
<h3>CartFlows Free Features</h3>
<h4>1. Modern Checkout Styles</h4>
<p>Replace the boring default WooCommerce checkout with a clean, conversion-focused experience that keeps buyers moving forward.</p>
<h4>2. Instant Layouts</h4>
<p>Skip the design work and launch a fully optimized sales funnel in minutes with professionally designed, ready-to-use layouts for every funnel step.</p>
<h4>3. Multi-Page Builder Support</h4>
<p>No matter your favorite page builder—Spectra, Elementor, Bricks, or Beaver—CartFlows works seamlessly with them all. Build beautiful, high-converting funnels your way, without limits or friction.</p>
<h4>4. Override Store Checkout</h4>
<p>Replace the default WooCommerce checkout with a streamlined, branded checkout experience. Whether it&#8217;s a single-step, two-step, or multi-step checkout, CartFlows gives you complete control over the WooCommerce checkout page—without writing a single line of code.</p>
<h4>5. Import Ready-Made Sales Funnels</h4>
<p>Why build from scratch? Import pre-made, conversion-optimized sales funnel templates with one click and start selling immediately. Every template is fully customizable using your page builder of choice.</p>
<h4>6. Checkout Form Field Editor</h4>
<p>Customize your WooCommerce checkout form fields with ease. Add, remove, reorder, or create custom fields to match your business needs and create a frictionless checkout experience that converts.</p>
<h4>7. Social Media Pixel Tracking</h4>
<p>Track customer actions across your entire funnel with built-in support for Google, Facebook, Pinterest, Snapchat, and TikTok pixels. Get deeper ad insights, retarget smarter, and turn more ad clicks into completed purchases.</p>
<h4>8. Automations with OttoKit</h4>
<p>Connect CartFlows to OttoKit to automate post-purchase workflows—send thank you emails, tag customers, notify your team, and manage leads—all without leaving WordPress. Integrates with 1,000+ apps including Gmail, Slack, Mailchimp, and more.</p>
<h3>CartFlows Pro Features</h3>
<h4>1. One-Click Upsells &amp; Downsells</h4>
<p>Show customers a perfectly timed post-purchase upsell offer they can accept with a single click—no re-entering payment details. Increase your average order value on every transaction with dynamic upsell paths that respond to what customers already bought.</p>
<h4>2. Dynamic Order Bumps</h4>
<p>Boost revenue with personalized order bumps placed right on the WooCommerce checkout page. Use smart rules to show the most relevant offer based on cart contents, total, or customer history. Features multiple modern order bump styles and custom placement options.</p>
<h4>3. A/B Split Testing</h4>
<p>Test multiple versions of your checkout pages, upsell offers, order bumps, and headlines to find what converts best. Make data-driven decisions and continuously optimize every step of your WordPress sales funnel.</p>
<h4>4. Advanced Funnel Analytics</h4>
<p>Track conversions, revenue per funnel step, average order value, and customer behavior from a unified analytics dashboard. Identify underperforming steps and make targeted improvements to maximize your store&#8217;s revenue.</p>
<h4>5. Smart Funnel Routing</h4>
<p>Create personalized funnel journeys based on what&#8217;s in the customer&#8217;s cart or their purchase history. Smart Funnel Routing dynamically directs buyers to the most relevant upsell path—increasing the likelihood of conversion at every step.</p>
<h4>6. Google Address Autocomplete</h4>
<p>Speed up checkout by letting customers autocomplete their shipping and billing address with Google Maps integration. Fewer keystrokes means fewer drop-offs—especially on mobile.</p>
<h4>7. Auto Apply Coupons</h4>
<p>Stop making customers hunt for discount codes. With Auto Apply Coupons, discounts are applied automatically at checkout when conditions are met—creating a smoother buying experience and reducing cart abandonment.</p>
<h4>8. Lead Generation Tools</h4>
<p>Build your email list while making sales. CartFlows&#8217; built-in opt-in pages and lead capture features let you create high-converting landing pages and squeeze pages that feed leads directly into your email marketing platform.</p>
<h4>9. Product Options</h4>
<p>Let customers personalize their purchase right at checkout—choose sizes, colors, quantities, or add-ons. With highlight product and quantity selection controls, you can present choices in a way that feels helpful, not overwhelming.</p>
<h4>10. Enhanced Subscription Handling</h4>
<p>Selling recurring products? CartFlows integrates with WooCommerce Subscriptions to handle auto-payment retries, proration for upgrades, and seamless subscription checkout flows.</p>
<h4>11. Conversion-Focused Funnel Templates</h4>
<p>Access the full library of premium, professionally designed sales funnel templates for every use case—eCommerce, courses, memberships, lead generation, and more. Import any template with one click and customize it with your page builder.</p>
<h4>12. Add Unlimited Funnel Steps</h4>
<p>Build complete, multi-step sales funnels with upsells, downsells, thank-you pages, opt-in steps, and more. With CartFlows Pro, there&#8217;s no limit to the number of funnels or steps you can create.</p>
<h3>✅ Who Can Benefit from CartFlows?</h3>
<p>CartFlows is the perfect WordPress funnel builder and WooCommerce checkout plugin for any store or business. Common use cases include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Ecommerce sellers</li>
<li>Course creators</li>
<li>Membership platforms</li>
<li>Freelancers and consultants</li>
<li>Marketing agencies</li>
<li>Small business owners</li>
<li>Service providers</li>
<li>Event planners and event organizers</li>
<li>Digital product vendors</li>
<li>Health and wellness professionals</li>
<li>Dropshippers</li>
<li>Nonprofits and charities</li>
<li>Local businesses</li>
<li>Financial advisors</li>
<li>Software companies</li>
<li>Fashion and apparel brands</li>
<li>Fitness coaches</li>
<li>Authors and publishers</li>
<li>Subscription box providers</li>
<li>Personal brands and bloggers</li>
<li>Real estate professionals</li>
<li>Educational institutions</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔗 Works Great With</h3>
<p>CartFlows is designed to work seamlessly alongside these powerful companion plugins:</p>
<p><a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/woo-cart-abandonment-recovery/" rel="ugc"><strong>Cart Abandonment Recovery</strong></a> for WooCommerce – Recover lost sales automatically by sending timed email sequences to shoppers who left without completing checkout. Pair with CartFlows to capture abandonment across every step of your funnel.</p>
<p><a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/modern-cart/" rel="ugc"><strong>Modern Cart for WooCommerce</strong></a> – Add a beautiful slide-out cart, floating cart icon, in-cart upsells, and a free shipping progress bar to your WooCommerce store. The perfect companion to CartFlows for a complete pre-to-post checkout funnel experience.</p>
<p><a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/power-coupons/" rel="ugc"><strong>Power Coupons for WooCommerce</strong></a> – Automatically apply discount rules at checkout based on cart conditions—no coupon codes required. Works alongside CartFlows&#8217; checkout to create smooth, incentivized buying experiences.</p>
<p><a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/variation-swatches-woo/" rel="ugc"><strong>Variation Swatches for WooCommerce</strong></a> – Replace boring WooCommerce dropdown variation selectors with visual color swatches, image thumbnails, and text labels. Makes product selection faster and more intuitive—especially on CartFlows checkout pages with variable products.</p>
<h3>Supported Themes, Plugins and Tools</h3>
