('Use Any Font | Custom Font Uploader', 'use-any-font', '6.3.14', '<p>Upload any custom fonts to give your site an elegant look. Easily change fonts without CSS knowledge or select from 23,871+ predefined fonts to add to your site, including Google fonts stored on your server.</p>
