<p><strong>Font Conversion API Usage</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>You need API key to connect to our server for font conversion. Our server converts your font and sends it back. You can get key from <a href="https://dineshkarki.com.np/use-any-font/api-key" rel="nofollow ugc">here</a>. You can also generate Lite / Test API key from button at top of the plugin page. <strong>Note : </strong> Lite / Test API only allow single font conversion.</li>
