<p>Elementor is a popular WordPress page builder plugin with over 10 million active installations. It allows users to design pages visually using a drag-and-drop interface, without needing to code.</p>
<p>By default, Elementor only includes Font Awesome icons, which can feel limited for many site builders. Skyboot Custom Icons for Elementor solves this by adding more than 14,300 icons across 15 packs. This gives you a wider selection to make your website more visually appealing and consistent with your design needs.</p>
