<p>To expand your Elementor icons library, install and activate the Skyboot Custom Icons for Elementor plugin. This adds more than 14,300 icons from 15 packs directly into Elementor&#8217;s icon picker.</p>
<p>The plugin is fully compatible with the latest version of Elementor and works with any Elementor-supported theme. After activation, simply open the Elementor editor, go to the icon selection panel, and you&#8217;ll see the new icons available alongside the default set.</p>
<p>You can easily customize icon size, color, and style inside Elementor&#8217;s interface—just like the built-in icons. This makes it simple to design visually consistent and attractive websites without needing extra coding or third-party tools.</p>
<h3>Are social icons available in this plugin?</h3>
<p>Skyboot is incredibly simple to use with the Elementor interface, and it&#8217;s compatible with any theme and plugin. In this one plugin, including Facebook icons, Instagram icon, Twitter icon, LinkedIn icon, Pinterest icon, YouTube icon, gallery icon,discord icons, email icons,custom icons, google map icons and many more. Every icone comes on many different veriation. All font icons free to use.</p>
<h4>Why should I expand the Elementor Icons List?</h4>
<p>Expanding the Elementor Icons list gives you access to a much larger variety of icons, helping you design more flexible and visually engaging layouts. A broader icon library makes it easier to meet specific design needs, represent different industries or features, and stay aligned with modern design trends and user expectations.</p>
<h4>Can I customize the icons in the Elementor Icon Set?</h4>
<p>Yes. All icons in the Elementor Icon Set can be fully customized directly inside Elementor. You can adjust the size, color, and alignment, and apply styling options to match your site&#8217;s branding and design. This flexibility ensures that icons blend seamlessly with your website&#8217;s overall look and feel.</p>
