* WooCommerce support<br />
* Translated into 25+ languages<br />
* SSL / HTTPS compatible<br />
* <strong>SEO-Friendly</strong> (Search Engine Optimization).<br />
* Tested with PHP 7 and PHP 8</p>
<p><strong><a href="https://fontsplugin.com/pro-upgrade/?utm_source=wporg&amp;utm_medium=readme&amp;utm_campaign=upsell" rel="nofollow ugc">Pro Features</a></strong><br />
* Host Google Fonts Locally — GDPR-compliant, no data sent to Google<br />
