<h4>Found a Bug?</h4>
<p>Please let us know via the <a href="https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/olympus-google-fonts#new-post" rel="ugc">support forum</a>. We read every report.</p>
<h4>Contribute</h4>
<p>Fonts Plugin is open source and welcomes contributions:</p>
