('Flex Interior Design', 'flex-interior-design', '1.0.1', 'Flex Interior Design is a clean and modern website theme designed for interior designers, architects, home decorators, furniture stores, and design studios who want to showcase their work professionally online. The theme includes responsive layout design, customizable homepage sections, portfolio showcase, service pages, gallery layouts, and contact form integration, making it suitable for business websites and creative portfolios. Flex Interior Design supports fast loading speed, SEO-friendly structure, mobile optimization, and easy customization options, allowing users to manage content, colors, fonts, and layouts without complex setup. It is suitable for interior design agencies, freelance designers, home styling experts, renovation services, and architecture firms looking to build a professional online presence. The theme focuses on portfolio display, project showcase, service information, and client contact features, making it practical for interior and home design related websites.', 'wordpress.org'),
('RazorCuts FSE', 'razorcuts-fse', '1.1', 'The RazorCuts FSE is a free developed as an advanced, performance-oriented online solution to barber businesses who wish to have the same level of accuracy, confidence, and professionalism on their online presence as they do offline. Modern-day highly competitive grooming businesses are building websites to increase their digital connectivity..', 'wordpress.org'),
