('Accepta', 'accepta', '1.0.4', 'Accepta is a modern, lightweight, and highly customizable WordPress theme perfect for businesses, creative agencies, and online stores. Designed with performance and flexibility in mind, it delivers exceptional user experience and optimal loading speeds. The theme features seamless integration with Elementor page builder, allowing you to create stunning layouts without coding. Built-in WooCommerce support makes it ideal for e-commerce websites with beautifully styled product pages, shop layouts, and checkout flows. Accepta offers multiple header layouts, flexible footer options, and a clean, professional design that adapts perfectly to any device. With extensive customization options through the WordPress Customizer, you can easily adjust colors, typography, layouts, and more to match your brand identity. The theme is translation-ready, SEO-optimized, and follows WordPress coding standards for reliability and security. Whether you''re building a business website, portfolio, blog, or online shop, Accepta provides the perfect foundation to bring your vision to life.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Second Coming', 'second-coming', '1.3.0', 'Matrix-style FSE child theme. Cyberpunk, animated rain, mobile-first.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Sports Outlet', 'sports-outlet', '0.2', 'Sports Outlet Theme is a modern and practical theme designed for sports-related websites that need a structured and clean layout. It works well for sports stores, fitness equipment shops, and activewear catalogs that require clear product presentation and easy navigation. The theme supports key features such as customizable sections, organized product grids, and flexible homepage layouts. It is compatible with WooCommerce, making it suitable for building an online sports shop without a complex setup. The theme also includes features that support product listings, category displays, and simple customization through the Customizer. The theme works smoothly with popular plugins and allows users to create a sports shop, fitness store, or sports accessories website efficiently. With support for sports products, athletic gear, training equipment, and activewear collections, Sports Outlet theme offers a reliable base for building a sports-focused eCommerce website.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Trendy Storefront', 'trendy-storefront', '1.2', 'Trendy Storefront is a versatile theme crafted to make your online store visually engaging and easy to navigate. Ideal for boutiques, lifestyle shops, and specialty eCommerce businesses, it lets you showcase products with organized layouts and clear category sections. Fully compatible with WooCommerce, the theme simplifies adding products, creating featured collections, and managing promotions. You can customize headers, adjust layouts, and choose color schemes that match your brand identity. With fast-loading pages, SEO-friendly coding, and mobile-ready design, Trendy Storefront delivers a smooth and efficient shopping experience for all visitors. Its intuitive structure ensures your customers can find products quickly while enjoying a visually appealing storefront. Whether you sell fashion, gadgets, or handmade goods, Trendy Storefront offers a reliable, adaptable, and performance-focused platform to grow your online business.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Marriage Counseling', 'marriage-counseling', '0.0.2', 'Marriage Counseling is designed for professionals offering relationship support and therapy services. It includes essential features such as appointment booking integration, service listings, contact forms, and responsive layouts for easy access on all devices. The clean design helps present information like counseling services, therapist profiles, session details, and client resources in a structured way. This theme is suitable for licensed counselors, therapists, psychologists, relationship coaches, and mental health clinics. It can also be used by individuals providing online therapy sessions or consultation services. Built with an SEO-friendly structure, fast loading speed, and customizable sections, it supports better visibility on search engines. Key elements like blog sections for relationship advice, testimonial areas, and secure contact options make it practical for real-world use. Marriage Counseling focuses on usability, accessibility, and clear communication, making it a functional choice for those offering professional counseling services online.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Pizzeria Online Delivery', 'pizzeria-online-delivery', '1.4', 'Pizzeria Online Delivery is a WordPress theme designed for pizza shops, restaurants, cafés, fast-food outlets, and cloud kitchens that want to offer online food ordering through their website. The theme uses a clean layout and is built to work with the WordPress block editor, allowing users to manage content without relying on external page builders. The theme integrates with WooCommerce, enabling website owners to create an online menu, manage orders, accept payments, and handle food delivery or takeaway options. It includes dedicated sections for menus, offers, testimonials, and business information, making it suitable for both single-location and multi-location restaurants. Pizzeria Online Delivery is responsive and adapts well to mobile, tablet, and desktop devices. The theme is optimized for performance and follows SEO-friendly coding practices to support better visibility in search engines. It can be used for new restaurant websites or for upgrading existing food ordering sites that require a structured and easy-to-manage layout.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Pixel Grove Dark', 'pixel-grove-dark', '1.1', 'Pixel Grove Dark is a modern WordPress Full Site Editing theme built for businesses, consulting firms, and SEO agencies that want a high-performing online presence. It combines powerful SEO optimization with native Gutenberg and WooCommerce compatibility, allowing you to build fast, flexible, block-based layouts with ease. Designed for scalability and user engagement, Pixel Grove Dark integrates smoothly with Contact Form 7, giving you the tools to showcase services, convert visitors, communicate with clients, and grow your brand. Experience the perfect balance of design, performance, and adaptability with Pixel Grove Dark, your streamlined gateway to digital success. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/pixel-grove-dark/', 'wordpress.org'),
('Bosa Startup Business', 'bosa-startup-business', '1.0.1', 'Bosa Startup Business is a modern, multipurpose WordPress theme crafted specifically for business websites. It’s fast, lightweight, responsive, and beautifully designed—perfect for tech startups, creative agencies, small businesses, consulting firms, e-commerce ventures, digital marketing companies, co-working spaces, entrepreneurial projects, business incubators, finance startups, real-estate startups, educational startups, product-based startups, service-based startups, innovation hubs, business coaches, freelancers and more. The Bosa Startup Business theme is built to work seamlessly with the Elementor page builder, allowing you to easily design pages using drag-and-drop functionality, including Header &amp; Footer Builder and Mega Menu support. With powerful features accessible via the live WordPress Customizer, you can personalize your site with ease. Bosa Startup Business includes pre-designed home and inner pages, supports one-click demo import, and offers flexibility to adapt the layout as needed. The Bosa Startup Business theme is optimized for speed and SEO and is fully compatible with major plugins like WooCommerce, ElementsKit, YITH, Yoast SEO, Contact Form 7, Mailchimp, bbPress, Loco Translate, and more. Explore the demo and see why Bosa Startup Business is the ideal theme for your business startup website: https://demo.bosathemes.com/bosa/startup-business/', 'wordpress.org'),
('Church Community', 'church-community', '1.2', 'Developed specifically for faith-based organizations, the Church Community theme provides a clean and structured framework for presenting sermons, ministries, announcements, and community updates. It includes organized sections for event schedules, leadership profiles, and service timings, ensuring visitors can easily access important information. The design emphasizes clear navigation, readable typography, and a balanced layout that supports effective content presentation. This theme features customizable homepage sections, widget-ready areas, SEO-friendly code, translation readiness, accessibility-focused structure, and flexible layout controls. Administrators can efficiently manage pages, publish messages, and update programs without complexity. Its responsive design maintains consistency across devices, while optimized performance supports smooth browsing. Built with practicality in mind, the Church Community theme focuses on usability, structured content display, and adaptable customization, making it a reliable choice for congregations seeking an organized and functional website solution.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Luxe Hair Salon', 'luxe-hair-salon', '1.4', 'Luxe Hair Salon is a modern, elegant WordPress block theme for hair salons, hairdresser, hairstylist, barbershop and beauty studio. Built for hair salon owners looking to grow their business online, this luxury salon theme helps you build a high converting salon website with Full Site Editing (Gutenberg), responsive layouts, one-page landing page support, and SEO-friendly performance with local business schema and Google Maps integration. Perfect for showcasing haircuts, men''s haircuts, kids haircuts, blowouts, hair coloring, balayage, highlights, toning, glossing, keratin treatments, bond repair treatments, perms, relaxers, Japanese straightening, scalp treatments, hair extensions, updos, and bridal/wedding hair. Includes sections for services and pricing, stylist/team profiles, before &amp; after galleries, testimonials, contact details, business hours, location/map, and online booking/appointments with support for third-party booking integrations. WooCommerce ready for selling hair products, salon packages, memberships, and loyalty programs. Also suits full-service beauty studios offering waxing, threading, lash extensions, and nail services. Theme features include custom fonts, Google Fonts, fast loading lightweight performance, and RTL support - ideal for single or multi-location salons and booth rental businesses.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Legal Notary Firm', 'legal-notary-firm', '1.0.2', 'Legal Notary Firm is a clean and structured theme designed for professionals who provide legal documentation and notary services. It offers a clear layout suitable for presenting services such as document verification, affidavit preparation, legal consultation, contracts, and certification services. The theme includes organized sections for service details, client information, appointment scheduling, and contact forms, helping visitors easily access important information. This theme can be used by notary public offices, legal consultants, attorneys, law firms, documentation agencies, and legal service providers who need a professional website to display their services online. It also supports common website elements such as service pages, team profiles, testimonials, and business contact details. With a responsive design and structured content layout, Legal Notary Firm helps legal professionals create a functional website for sharing legal services, managing client inquiries, and presenting notary-related information in a clear and accessible format.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Scandi Fashion Nook', 'scandi-fashion-nook', '1.0.2', 'Scandi Fashion Nook is a child theme for Fashion Nook, designed for women''s fashion boutiques, clothing stores, and WooCommerce shops with a Scandinavian aesthetic. Built for slow fashion brands, knitwear stores, loungewear shops, and capsule wardrobe collections, Scandi Fashion Nook brings Nordic minimalism to your online store — clean layouts, warm neutrals, and editorial typography designed to let your products shine. Perfect for boutique fashion brands, sustainable clothing stores, and style-driven WooCommerce shops inspired by Scandinavian design. Scandi Fashion Nook requires the Fashion Nook parent theme and inherits its full site editing support, block theme framework, and WordPress Site Editor compatibility — no page builder required.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Computer Repair Solutions', 'computer-repair-solutions', '10.0', 'At Computer Repair Solutions, we provide high-quality repair, maintenance, and optimization services for all types of computers. Whether your system is running slow, showing errors, or refusing to turn on, our certified technicians quickly identify the issue and deliver reliable solutions. We combine technical expertise with transparent service to ensure your device performs at its best—without heavy costs.', 'wordpress.org'),
('CuraWell', 'curawell', '1.0.2', 'CuraWell is a lightweight, responsive WordPress theme made for dental clinics and oral care professionals. With Elementor support, clean layouts, customizable colors, and translation support, it''s everything you need to launch a professional dental website.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Isjharportfolio', 'isjharportfolio', '1.0.5', 'A minimalist and responsive block theme designed for a resume and portfolio site with many reusable patterns.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Fitness Instructor', 'fitness-instructor', '1.0.2', 'The Fitness Instructor theme is designed for trainers, coaches, gyms, and wellness professionals who want to present their services clearly on a structured website. It supports use cases such as personal trainer websites, fitness coach portfolios, gym training programs, and online workout classes. The layout focuses on organizing essential information like training schedules, instructor profiles, workout programs, and client testimonials. This fitness instructor theme offers flexible sections that help highlight health coaching services, yoga instructor pages, and fitness studio information without a complex setup. Users can create pages for workout plans, nutrition guidance, and training sessions, making it suitable for both individual trainers and small fitness centers. With clean design elements and organized content blocks, the theme helps build a practical fitness training website where visitors can easily explore services, schedules, and instructor details.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Devroot', 'devroot', '1.0.4', 'A minimal, developer-focused WordPress starter theme.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Dridhata', 'dridhata', '1.0.0', 'Dridhata is a multipurpose WordPress theme featuring a solid, colorful, brutalist design with black, white and pink color accents. It is suitable for a wide range of websites, including business, portfolio, blog, and content-focused sites. The theme supports popular plugins such as Elementor for page building, WooCommerce for basic shop functionality, and Contact Form 7 for form management. It includes customizable layout options through the WordPress Customizer, block-based template parts, and a structured admin setup. Dridhata is fully responsive and designed to display consistently across different screen sizes and devices. No coding knowledge is required to configure the theme’s core features.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Minimind', 'minimind', '1.1.0', 'A simple minimal blog theme to help embrace the a minimal mindset. Minimind provides a clean and clear display for image light blogs.', 'wordpress.org'),
('IT Software Technology', 'it-software-technology', '1.4', 'IT Software Technology is a modern, powerful website theme designed for businesses working in the evolving world of IT software technology. Created for startups, software companies, digital agencies, and consulting firms, this theme delivers a professional foundation for building trustworthy and scalable online platforms. With a responsive layout and performance-optimized framework, IT Software Technology ensures smooth browsing across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme supports industries involved in software development, cloud computing, cybersecurity, data analytics, and artificial intelligence, allowing businesses to present their services and innovations with confidence. The theme includes flexible templates for service pages, portfolios, case studies, product presentations, and client testimonials. Its simple customization panel allows full control over layout, fonts, colors, and branding. Developers benefit from clean, well-structured code that simplifies advanced customization and supports modern software engineering workflows. IT Software Technology integrates seamlessly with essential plugins, enabling features such as contact forms, lead generation, performance tracking, and CRM tools. This makes it an ideal choice for companies offering web development, enterprise software, application development, network security, and IT consulting services. Search engine optimization is built into the theme’s architecture, helping your site achieve stronger visibility in competitive technology solutions and information technology markets. Multilingual and RTL compatibility ensures global accessibility, while fast-loading pages enhance user experience and engagement. Whether you are launching a startup, expanding a software firm, or rebranding a technology agency, IT Software Technology provides a reliable, flexible, and growth-ready design framework to showcase expertise, attract clients, and strengthen your digital presence.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Bizvera', 'bizvera', '1.0.2', 'BizVera is a Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme designed for business and corporate websites. It supports block-based customization, responsive layouts, and includes patterns and templates for common business sections. Check the real demo: https://demos.trendthemeswp.com/bizvera', 'wordpress.org'),
('Promptless', 'promptless', '1.1.0', 'A minimal WordPress theme designed to work seamlessly with the Promptless WP plugin. Inherits colors, typography, and styling from the plugin''s Global Settings for a unified brand experience.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Keahi', 'keahi', '1.0.2', 'Minimalist portfolio and personal website theme for freelancers, designers, developers, and professionals. Warm cream background, bold typography, red accents. Full Site Editing, 5 starter patterns, no code required.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Hair Dresser and Salon', 'hair-dresser-and-salon', '1.2', 'The Hair Dresser and Salon Theme is designed with a clean, stylish, and modern layout that instantly reflects beauty and professionalism. The homepage usually features a full-width banner with high-quality images, bold typography, and a clear call-to-action button such as “Book an Appointment.” The layout flows smoothly from services to testimonials, pricing, and contact details, making navigation simple and engaging. Every section is arranged neatly to highlight your salon’s expertise and visual appeal. This theme focuses on showcasing services in an elegant and organized way. You can display haircuts, styling, coloring, spa treatments, bridal makeup, and grooming services with attractive service boxes and pricing tables. The design often includes soft color palettes, trendy fonts, and image galleries that create a luxurious and welcoming vibe. With a dedicated gallery section, you can present before-and-after transformations to build trust and attract new clients. A Hair Dresser and Salon Theme also comes with an integrated appointment booking system. This feature allows clients to schedule services online without making a phone call. It saves time and improves customer experience. Many themes support staff profile sections where you can introduce hairstylists and beauty experts with their photos and specialties, helping clients feel more connected. The theme is fully responsive, which means it looks stunning on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. It also supports social media integration so you can link your Instagram or Facebook page to showcase your latest styles. With SEO-friendly coding and fast-loading pages, the theme helps your salon rank better in search engines. Overall, a Hair Dresser and Salon Theme gives you a polished online presence that attracts clients and grows your beauty business.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Spa Parlor', 'spa-parlor', '1.0.3', 'Spa Parlor is a clean and structured theme designed for wellness and beauty service websites, suitable for spa centers, massage therapists, beauty salons, wellness clinics, skincare studios, and health-focused services that need a clear online presence. It provides organized layouts to present services, pricing, treatment details, staff information, and contact sections so visitors can easily navigate the content. The theme includes a responsive design, customizable sections, service listing layouts, testimonial areas, and blog support to share updates, skincare tips, and general wellness content while maintaining a consistent structure. It also supports dedicated service pages, appointment information sections, image galleries, and contact forms, helping visitors understand available treatments and offerings. This theme can be used by spa owners to outline their services, salon managers to maintain structured service listings, massage centers to display treatment details, beauty professionals to present their work, wellness consultants to share insights, and other service providers who need a straightforward way to display business information online.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Construction Equipments', 'construction-equipments', '1.1', 'The Construction Equipments is designed for construction companies, heavy equipment rental agencies, civil engineering firms, and building contractors seeking a structured and professional web presence. It features a multipurpose layout that supports service listings, project showcases, and company information within a clean and organized interface. The design follows a minimal and modern approach with elegant typography and a sophisticated visual hierarchy suitable for industrial and technical businesses. Built with bootstrap, the theme is responsive and mobile friendly, ensuring consistent performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. It is Retina ready and uses optimized codes and clean code practices to support faster page load time and stable performance. The framework emphasizes secure and clean code, making it suitable for long-term website management by a Developer or in-house technical team. The homepage typically includes a prominent Banner section, Call to Action Button (CTA), testimonial section, and Team profiles to present company credentials and workforce details. Animated and interactive elements are included where appropriate, offering a dynamic yet professional browsing experience. Shortcodes simplify content placement, allowing structured presentation of services, equipment catalogs, and project portfolios. Customization Options and personalization options enable users to adjust colors, layouts, fonts, and content blocks without extensive coding knowledge. The Construction Equipments is translation ready, supporting multilingual websites for firms operating in multiple regions. Social media integration allows companies to connect their platforms directly from the site. Overall, the theme provides a beautiful yet practical framework with an agency friendly structure, suitable for businesses requiring a modern, structured, and visually polished online presence.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Explorer Blog', 'explorer-blog', '0.0.2', 'Explorer Blog is a clean and modern WordPress theme designed for travel bloggers, explorers, and storytellers. Whether you’re documenting your adventures, sharing travel tips, or publishing destination guides, Explorer Blog provides a beautiful layout that keeps your content front and center. Built with the power of WordPress Full Site Editing, the theme is fast, flexible, and easy to customize, allowing you to create a stunning travel blog without touching code.', 'wordpress.org'),
('NewSpare', 'newspare', '4.0.2', 'NewSpare is a high-performance, Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme expertly crafted for news, magazines, and professional blogs. Built to leverage the full power of the Gutenberg block editor, it offers unparalleled flexibility with a wide range of pre-built starter sites and seamless integration with the BlockSpare plugin. NewSpare features elegant light and dark color modes to enhance the reading experience, alongside full WooCommerce support for integrated e-commerce capabilities. Optimized for speed and SEO to boost search engine rankings, the theme includes RTL language support, responsive design, and live preview customization. Whether you are building a publishing hub, a review site, or a personal blog, NewSpare provides a sophisticated, user-friendly foundation with dedicated support and comprehensive documentation available at https://afthemes.com/products/newspare/.', 'wordpress.org'),
('WENS Adventure', 'wens-adventure', '1.0.2', 'WENS Adventure is a modern and dynamic WordPress theme designed specifically for travel agencies, tour operators, and businesses focused on adventure. It aims to help users create a powerful online presence. Built with the latest Full Site Editing (FSE) capabilities, this theme offers complete flexibility, allowing you to customize every aspect of your website using intuitive block-based tools—no coding needed. The theme integrates seamlessly with the WP Travel plugin, enabling you to manage trips, itineraries, bookings, and pricing effortlessly. This makes it an ideal choice for building a comprehensive travel booking platform. With its clean and engaging design, WENS Adventure allows you to showcase destinations, highlight tour packages, and share travel stories in a visually appealing manner. WENS Adventure includes pre-designed templates and reusable block patterns that help you create professional pages quickly while maintaining consistency across your site. It is fully responsive and optimized for performance, ensuring fast loading speeds and a smooth browsing experience on all devices, from desktops to smartphones. Additionally, the theme is SEO-friendly, allowing you to reach a wider audience and expand your travel business globally. Whether you operate adventure tours, trekking expeditions, travel blogs, or destination-based booking services, WENS Adventure provides all the tools you need to inspire visitors and convert them into customers.', 'wordpress.org'),
