('Business AI', 'business-ai', '1.0.1', 'A modern, light business WordPress theme with smooth animations and a professional layout. Every section, text, and color is fully customizable through the WordPress Customizer with live preview — no coding required. Built with AI-powered businesses in mind. This is the full version of the theme. Perfect for SaaS companies, agencies, startups, and all kinds of businesses.', 'wordpress.org'),
