('Relyo', 'relyo', '1.0.4', 'Relyo is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme crafted for construction companies, contractors, builders, and engineering firms who want to present their work with strength, clarity, and professionalism. Built entirely with Gutenberg blocks, Relyo gives you complete control over layouts, templates, and global styles—without writing a single line of code. The theme features a bold yet clean, performance-focused design that highlights projects, services, expertise, and client trust while maintaining a professional construction aesthetic. With customizable patterns, responsive layouts, and seamless block-based editing, Relyo makes it easy to create impactful construction websites, company profiles, and project showcases. Fully compatible with WordPress’s latest FSE capabilities, Relyo ensures flexibility, scalability, and a future-ready foundation—perfect for construction businesses that value reliability, performance, and strong visual presentation.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Decor Shop', 'decor-shop', '0.0.3', 'The Decor Shop is a multipurpose WordPress theme designed for websites focused on home decoration and interior accessories. It provides a structured layout suitable for showcasing wall art, lighting decor, and furniture accents in an organized manner. The design follows a minimal and elegant approach, using clean typography and balanced spacing to create a sophisticated browsing experience. Built with bootstrap, the theme ensures a responsive and mobile-friendly layout that adapts to different screen sizes. It is retina-ready, allowing images and graphics to appear sharp on high-resolution displays. The codebase follows clean code practices with optimized codes that support faster page load time and stable performance. Developers can work with secure and clean code to extend features or integrate additional functionality as needed. The homepage includes a customizable Banner section, Call to Action Button (CTA), testimonial section, and Team display area. These built-in sections allow businesses to present information clearly without requiring extensive configuration. Integrated shortcodes make it easier to add structured content blocks, while animated and interactive elements provide subtle visual engagement without overwhelming the layout. The theme offers multiple Customization Options through the WordPress Customizer, enabling adjustments to colors, fonts, layouts, and content sections. Personalization options allow users to tailor the appearance to suit modern or luxurious branding preferences while maintaining a clean and professional look. Social media integration supports linking to external profiles directly from the website interface. As an agency-friendly solution, the theme can be used for retail stores, design studios, or creative agencies. It is translation-ready, making it suitable for multilingual websites. Overall, the Decor Shop Theme combines a beautiful yet structured design with practical features, making it appropriate for businesses that require a modern, minimal, and organized online presence.', 'wordpress.org'),
