('Futuristic Vision', 'futuristic-vision', '1.0.4', 'Futuristic Vision is a modern theme designed for websites that focus on technology, innovation, and digital services. It features a clean futuristic design inspired by neo futuristic aesthetics, making it suitable for startups, SaaS platforms, and technology-driven businesses. The layout emphasizes clarity, structure, and usability while maintaining a visually engaging modern interface. This approach supports projects related to future technology, digital innovation, and tech platforms. Typography and spacing are carefully structured to ensure content readability across different sections, including homepages, service pages, and blog layouts. Futuristic Vision includes customizable sections for showcasing IT services, digital platforms, and enterprise solutions. It works well for companies focused on AI technology, data analytics, cloud technology, or smart systems, allowing users to present technical information in a clear and organized format. Page templates are designed to support startup technology, business technology, and innovation-driven projects. The theme integrates smoothly with the block editor, enabling users to build and manage content without relying on external builders. Color schemes, fonts, and layout options can be adjusted using the Customizer, supporting flexible branding for digital businesses and tech startups. Code structure follows theme development standards to ensure stability and compatibility with commonly used plugins. Overall, Futuristic Vision provides a structured foundation for creating futuristic websites focused on digital future, tech innovation, and next generation solutions, while maintaining a practical and standards-compliant approach suitable for long-term website development.', 'wordpress.org'),
