('SaaS Startup', 'saas-startup', '1.8', 'SaaS Startup is a flexible WordPress theme built for one purpose: helping you convert more visitors into customers. Designed for business, blogging, and publishing, it’s the perfect fit for any modern company, agency, or creator who wants a clean, high-impact digital presence. Whether you’re building a SaaS landing page, promoting AI tools, showcasing software products, running an affiliate blog, or launching a digital app, this WordPress powerhouse gives you the freedom to grow fast. Built with Full Site Editing and a fully block-based foundation, SaaS Startup works beautifully with Gutenberg, FSE, and every major page builder — including Elementor. You get pre-built sections for marketing, portfolio, review, and one page layouts, plus a minimalist, minimal, and polished design that adapts to any style, from corporate to technology, IT, fintech, and artificial intelligence startups. Prefer a sleeker look? Switch instantly from dark mode to light colors for a new modern feel. SaaS Startup is optimized for SEO, search engines, and high conversion rate performance. It’s one of the fastest, most responsive, and most mobile friendly themes in its class, making it ideal for adsense, affiliate, and blogger monetization setups. Build landing page funnels, long-form writing layouts, journal or news sites, or full ecommerce shops with WooCommerce — all with the same effortless setup. Because it’s incredibly easy to use and ships with a free starter template, SaaS Startup is perfect for writers, agencies, publishers, entrepreneurs, and anyone who wants a professional online presence without complexity. It’s crafted for high performance, built for growth, and ready for whatever you create next. If you want the best balance of conversion-focused design, flexibility, and speed in a modern WordPress theme, SaaS Startup is the smart choice to power your journey.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Jewelry Outlet', 'jewelry-outlet', '0.0.5', 'The Jewelry Outlet Theme is a modern, elegant, and fully responsive theme designed specifically for jewelry stores, boutiques, and online accessory shops. With a clean and sophisticated layout, this theme allows you to showcase your products beautifully, whether it’s rings, necklaces, bracelets, or earrings. Built for both beginners and experienced users, the Jewelry Outlet Theme ensures your website looks professional on all devices, including desktops, tablets, and smartphones. This theme is highly customizable, offering multiple homepage layouts, attractive product galleries, and smooth navigation for an outstanding user experience. Whether you are running a small local jewelry store or a large e-commerce outlet, this theme provides the flexibility to highlight featured products, new arrivals, and special collections. The Jewelry Outlet Theme is fully compatible with WooCommerce, making it easy to manage your online store, handle payments, and track orders efficiently. With SEO-optimized code and fast-loading pages, your website will rank higher in search engines, attracting more customers to your jewelry business. Additional features include custom widgets, social media integration, blog layouts for sharing tips or jewelry trends, and advanced typography options to give your site a unique identity. Ideal for showcasing luxury, fine jewelry, costume jewelry, or designer pieces, the Jewelry Outlet Theme ensures your products shine while providing a seamless shopping experience. Elevate your online presence and grow your jewelry business with a theme that combines elegance, performance, and user-friendliness.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Lazzari Blog Magazine', 'lazzari-blog-magazine', '1.0.4', 'Lazzari Blog Magazine WordPress Theme is a minimalist theme, focusing on simplicity and elegance, ideal for personal blogs or portfolios. Clean design, smart white space and clear typography help highlight content, suitable for sharing stories, creative articles, or artistic images. Optimized for speed, multi-device responsiveness, basic SEO integration, drag and drop support (Elementor), easy color and font customization and dark/light mode compatibility. Perfect for users who love minimalist style, want to focus on smooth reading experience and build a professional personal brand. Install easy: 1. Upload Theme. 2. Install &amp; Active Recommend Plugins. 3. Import demo data. Check the theme documentation and detail at: https://crthemes.com/theme/mushava-minimal-blog-wordpress-theme', 'wordpress.org'),
('Blockskit Charity', 'blockskit-charity', '1.0.1', 'Blockskit Charity is a modern, versatile FSE WordPress theme designed for charity, donation, campaign, events, foundation, fundraising, ngo, nonprofit, organization, care, religion, social, volunteer, and other charity websites—no coding required. With full-site editing, you can easily customize every aspect of your site, including headers and footers. Featuring multiple templates, patterns, and style variations, it adapts seamlessly to various aesthetics and business needs.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Siara Accounting', 'siara-accounting', '1.0.1', 'The Siara Accounting WordPress theme is a versatile and professional solution designed specifically for accountants, financial consultants, and businesses in the finance industry. Siara provides everything you need to create a polished, trustworthy online presence. Whether you''re offering tax services, bookkeeping, or financial advisory, this theme helps you present your services in a way that resonates with your clients. With Siara, you can easily create a website that highlights your expertise, showcases your services, and builds client confidence. The theme’s intuitive structure ensures that visitors can quickly find information about your firm, your team, and your range of accounting services.', 'wordpress.org'),
('TP Blogist', 'tp-blogist', '1.0.1', 'TP Blogist is a clean, modern, and versatile child theme of Themepalace FSE, crafted especially for bloggers, writers, and content creators. Built on the power of Full Site Editing (FSE), it gives you complete control over the layout, typography, and overall design of your website using the WordPress block editor. With its lightweight structure and optimized codebase, TP Blogist delivers fast performance and an exceptional browsing experience. The theme is fully responsive, ensuring your blog looks stunning across all screen sizes and devices, and it maintains smooth compatibility with all major browsers. Whether you''re sharing personal stories, publishing professional articles, or running a niche content site, TP Blogist provides a flexible and elegant foundation for building a beautiful, content-driven online presence.', 'wordpress.org'),
('Iris - AI Homepage, Chatbot Site Assistant', 'iris-ai-homepage-chatbot-site-assistant', '1.0.3', 'Iris - AI Homepage, Chatbot Site Assistant Theme is a modern, performance-focused WordPress block theme designed specifically for websites using the plugin "Iris AI – AI Homepage, Chatbot Site Assistant".It provides a fully optimized layout and ready-made design patterns that highlight the power of AI-driven customer support, intelligent content assistance, and real-time visitor engagement.Whether you’re building a business website, SaaS landing page, personal brand, or knowledge platform, the IrisAI Theme gives you a professional foundation to showcase your content and activate AI features without writing a single line of code.', 'wordpress.org'),
